[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8941.79, "timestamp": "02:29:01", "text": "因为手机太烫了，我不得不……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8945.75, "timestamp": "02:29:05", "text": "呃，就像切换回我自己……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8947.469, "timestamp": "02:29:07", "text": "溪流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8951.15, "timestamp": "02:29:11", "text": "是的，她说没关系，嗯，就像我一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8954.55, "timestamp": "02:29:14", "text": "我想知道，说话是不是很糟糕？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8957.63, "timestamp": "02:29:17", "text": "关于诸如你想听什么之类的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8961.429, "timestamp": "02:29:21", "text": "这种东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8964.429, "timestamp": "02:29:24", "text": "这就是我感到如此沮丧的原因，就像我知道如果一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8968.59, "timestamp": "02:29:28", "text": "观众说这很糟糕，我的错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8972.59, "timestamp": "02:29:32", "text": "就像，呃，呃，这就像不尊重……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8974.309, "timestamp": "02:29:34", "text": "感受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8978.269, "timestamp": "02:29:38", "text": "主播或者像CHS之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8980.63, "timestamp": "02:29:40", "text": "没错，她真的很冷静。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8983.429, "timestamp": "02:29:43", "text": "集体和经验事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8986.59, "timestamp": "02:29:46", "text": "是的，就这些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8991.309, "timestamp": "02:29:51", "text": "很好，一切都很好，一切都很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8996.309, "timestamp": "02:29:56", "text": "她已经走了这么远，就像她……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.15, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "长这么大了，长这么大了，该怎么说呢？"}]